    "body": "> [WICG/idle-detection#46](https://github.com/WICG/idle-detection/pull/46) recently fixed this same problem for the Idle Detection API. You can use `<dfn permission export>\"bluetooth\"</dfn>` to define the name of the permission within this specification and `<a permission>\"bluetooth\"</a>` to reference it.\r\n\r\nFixed. Thanks for the pointer!",
